{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_adr_017_initial_setup_wizard", "label": "ADR-017 Initial setup wizard (GraphQL 0.9.0)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-017-initial-setup-wizard.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_017_initial_setup_wizard_setup_wizard", "label": "/setup onboarding wizard", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-017-initial-setup-wizard.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Syed judged a product with no way in to be vaporware; every step must be a real write the rest of the product consumes, not a form collecting text for later. First navigation group, every role reads, administrators edit; dashboard call to action until the twin is generated."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_017_initial_setup_wizard_update_organization", "label": "Mutation.updateOrganization (business units create tenants)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-017-initial-setup-wizard.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A new business unit creates a tenant with a slug derived from its name because the directory resolves Keycloak tenant claims by slug; setting users' claims stays an administrator task outside OpenMap (REQ-SEC-009)."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_017_initial_setup_wizard_upsert_site", "label": "Mutation.upsertSite / removeSite", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-017-initial-setup-wizard.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Writes the site row (migration 0011) and creates the site CI through the outbox with identity { code } as the estate generator records it, so later discovery reconciles onto the same identity key; the code cannot change. removeSite refuses while a Node or link references the site."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_017_initial_setup_wizard_upsert_site_link", "label": "Mutation.upsertSiteLink (site_link CI connected_to both sites)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-017-initial-setup-wizard.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_017_initial_setup_wizard_register_node", "label": "Mutation.registerNode (one-time enrolment token)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-017-initial-setup-wizard.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mints the token exactly as the scheduler's node-register CLI did (SHA-256 digest stored, token returned once) and the wizard prints the openmap-node enrol command from DISCOVERY_NODE_ENV; CLI registration remains for automation."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_017_initial_setup_wizard_save_credential_set", "label": "Mutation.saveCredentialSet (OpenBao KV v2)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-017-initial-setup-wizard.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Validates fields against CREDENTIAL_FIELDS (the names the Go collectors read), writes to OpenBao under the reference and keeps only the reference in onboarding_states.credentialRefs; the API never returns a value and the audit interceptor redacts them. Credentials cross the API process once, from the request to the vault."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_017_initial_setup_wizard_credential_fields", "label": "CREDENTIAL_FIELDS in the collector contract", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-017-initial-setup-wizard.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_017_initial_setup_wizard_add_discovery_scope", "label": "Mutation.addDiscoveryScope (subnet CI located_in site)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-017-initial-setup-wizard.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Creates a subnet CI with credential reference and type as scope attributes so the planner (ADR-015) turns it into jobs for the site's Node; the same CIDR again updates instead of duplicating."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_017_initial_setup_wizard_generate_twin", "label": "Mutation.generateTwin (runs first sweep)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-017-initial-setup-wizard.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ensures every site and link has its CI, records generatedAt, marks all steps complete and runs runDiscovery; with no online Node the sweep is planned and waits for enrolment."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_017_initial_setup_wizard_onboarding_steps", "label": "ONBOARDING_STEPS / onboardingSchema / onboarding_states", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-017-initial-setup-wizard.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_017_initial_setup_wizard_ci_repository_create_retire", "label": "CI repository create / retire / findCurrentByIdentity", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-017-initial-setup-wizard.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Follows the reconciler's identity key convention so hand-created CIs and discovered CIs reconcile onto the same key."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_017_initial_setup_wizard_secrets_service_write", "label": "Secrets service write / describe", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-017-initial-setup-wizard.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_017